      {
        "text": "According to Ren Zu’s biography, wealth Gu is made from blue sea water, Ren Zu’s hands, worry Gu, difficulty Gu, sadness Gu, wisdom Gu, and stupidity Gu. Shi Zhong of Western Desert’s Shi clan holds worry Gu, difficulty Gu, and sadness Gu among the mortal Gu for that incomplete Immortal Gu recipe work, and the text notes they are not hard to get.",
